"\"use strict\";Object.defineProperty(exports,\"__esModule\",{value:true});Object.defineProperty(exports,\"default\",{enumerable:true,get:function(){return MDXContent}});function _extends(){_extends=Object.assign||function(target){for(var i=1;i<arguments.length;i++){var source=arguments[i];for(var key in source){if(Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(source,key)){target[key]=source[key]}}}return target};return _extends.apply(this,arguments)}function _createMdxContent(props){var _components=_extends({a:\"a\",blockquote:\"blockquote\",h2:\"h2\",h3:\"h3\",p:\"p\"},props.components);return Vue.h(Vue.Fragment,null,Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Maybe I’d be better off dating the J-20 and J-16 (?)\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"—— CEFINE, 2024-02-15 13:12\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Profile\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Every time I scrolled through Nimao’s profile, the first thing I would definitely see was a notification that he had changed his avatar.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Judging from the very few bio statuses he left behind, he was probably a kid who really liked mecha girls and gun girls; just like the quote above, which was also a part of his bio.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"No one could have imagined that someone so optimistic, who hung out in group chats every day and spent so much time surfing the web, bringing endless warmth to his friends, was enduring immense physical and psychological pressure behind the screen…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Memories\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h3,null,\"By: _AloneStar_\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"He and I had known each other quite a long time. As of today, he had been on my friends list for four years, but I didn’t know him all that well. He seemed to never mention a word about his real life. However, I do recall him mentioning his illness once.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In short, he said he would probably lose his ability to take care of himself soon. He was such a poor kid... Yet he still chatted in groups and played games every day as usual. He didn’t seem anxious about it at all, and occasionally even shared some nice pictures in the group. You couldn’t tell at all that he was a kid with a terminal illness.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h3,null,\"By: Arista\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Nimao was a very interesting and fun person... I’m not good at describing my feelings, but in short, he was just a really fun person. During the time we spent together, he brought me endless joy. “Fun” is the highest praise I can give him.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h3,null,\"“We’ll Meet Again Tomorrow” By: Heibuzai\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"It feels a bit late to be writing this.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Nimao, I used to call you Maomao (Cat). You used to go by Maomao, after all, and I don't know when you started being called Nimao.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"You were one of the earliest friends I ever made on QQ. I can’t quite remember how long we had known each other, and it’s no longer visible in the friend details anymore, because there was a period when I deleted a lot of my friends out of spite. I felt like none of you cared about me, and thought that maybe doing that would get your attention. It was childish.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"A very long time ago, you were the one who added me and invited me to play with you. I was so happy. I really liked you, and even now I still remember all those times we spent playing Minecraft together. But perhaps because of that, I felt the distance between us even more. In the little world of QQ, you were always surrounded by so many people, and little by little, I felt myself being pushed out of your sight. Maybe it was just my own mind playing tricks on me, but I felt like you weren’t as close to me as you used to be…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"I tried my best to fit into your world, learning about the games you played and getting to know your friends, even though I was a little clumsy at it. But you left, on July 3rd.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"You know, I miss you so much. I don’t know what place I held in your heart, or what colour I was there. But Maomao, in my heart, you were never just an ordinary online friend. Ever since I first got into QQ as a social platform, you were one of the most colourful, and one of the most important friends I had ever met there. Perhaps we may never know who you really were behind the screen, but we will always know “Nimaomao”.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"I don’t know how others feel about this, but I will never forget you. You will become the unique “Maomao” in my memory.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"We will meet again tomorrow, even though that may never be possible.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"My dearest friend.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Departure\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Nimao’s departure was very unexpected and sudden... It was as if a drop of water had disappeared into the sea, nowhere to be found, or like a candle that had burned down to its last wick. He completely disappeared from the internet.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"At first, his friends just thought he wasn’t feeling well and needed to rest for a while. But as time slowly passed, people seemed to realize there was a problem. It wasn’t until his phone was taken over by his family that we learned his illness wasn’t some ordinary sickness, but rather—\",Vue.h(\"sup\",null,Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-1\",id:\"footnote-ref-1\"},\"1\"))),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"div\",{style:\"text-align: center; color: #d32f2f; font-size: 1.8em; font-weight: bold; margin: 30px 0; letter-spacing: 2px;\"},Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis\")),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"It was only then that most of his friends learned that the optimistic Nimao was suffering from a terminal illness, yet he had still left behind his cheerful presence on the internet.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"On July 3rd, Nimao sank to the bottom of the sea in his sleep. ALS made him unable to breathe on his own. He was tired, and didn’t want to endure the physical and psychological pain anymore, so he closed his eyes and left this world forever.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“One day, we won’t need to say goodbye; we’ll only need to say goodnight.”\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Goodnight, Nimao.\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Contributors for this entry: _AloneStar_, Arista, Heibuzai\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"ol\",null,Vue.h(\"li\",{id:\"footnote-1\"},\"Further reading: \",Vue.h(_components.a,{href:\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ALS\"},\"Amyotrophic lateral sclerosis\"),\" on Wikipedia.\",Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-ref-1\"},Vue.h(\"svg\",{viewBox:\"0 0 16 16\",version:\"1.1\",id:\"svg1\",\"xmlns:xlink\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\",xmlns:\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"xmlns:svg\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",style:\"margin-left: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: -2px; width: 1rem; height: 1rem\"},Vue.h(\"defs\",{id:\"defs1\"},Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{id:\"linearGradient3\"},Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:1;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop3\"}),Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:0;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop4\"})),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{id:\"linearGradient1\"},Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:0;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop1\"}),Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:1;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop2\"})),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{\"xlink:href\":\"#linearGradient1\",id:\"linearGradient2\",x1:\"2.6681123\",y1:\"8\",x2:\"13.331888\",y2:\"8\",gradientUnits:\"userSpaceOnUse\",gradientTransform:\"translate(2.6678295,-2)\"}),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{\"xlink:href\":\"#linearGradient3\",id:\"linearGradient4\",x1:\"3.7075224\",y1:\"8\",x2:\"12.292478\",y2:\"8\",gradientUnits:\"userSpaceOnUse\"})),Vue.h(\"g\",{id:\"layer1\",transform:\"translate(0,2)\"},Vue.h(\"circle\",{style:\"fill:#cccccc;fill-opacity:0;stroke:url(#linearGradient2);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:square;paint-order:stroke fill markers\",id:\"path1\",cx:\"10.667834\",cy:\"6\",r:\"4.5818877\"}),Vue.h(\"path\",{style:\"fill:#cccccc;fill-opacity:0;stroke:#ff8373;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:square;paint-order:stroke fill markers\",d:\"M 9.9178343,10.577036 H 1.7971455\",id:\"path2\"}),Vue.h(\"path\",{style:\"fill:#cccccc;fill-opacity:0;stroke:url(#linearGradient4);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:square;paint-order:stroke fill markers\",id:\"path3\",d:\"M 8.0000001,11.231817 4.7681825,8.0000001 7.9999999,4.7681825 11.231817,7.9999999 Z\",transform:\"translate(-3.6894439,2.577036)\"})))))))}function MDXContent(props){if(props===void 0)props={};var _ref=props.components||{},MDXLayout=_ref.wrapper;return MDXLayout?Vue.h(MDXLayout,_extends({},props),Vue.h(_createMdxContent,_extends({},props))):_createMdxContent(props)}"